-shiji-051-jingyan","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p009","quote":"澤王燕二年，薨，謚為敬王。傳子嘉，為康王。","source_term":"傳子嘉"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji051-002","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra"}},{"id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_AA","label":"定國（荊燕世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"定國","mention_ids":["c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0002","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0031","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0049","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0052","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0085","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0105","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0126"]},{"surface":"燕王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0218","c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0222","c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0116"]},{"surface":"燕王定國","mention_ids":["c-shiji-112-pingjin:m023-0008"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0049","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0085","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0105","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0126","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0218","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p028","quote":"燕王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0222","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p028","quote":"燕王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m023-0008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p023","quote":"燕王定國"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m025-0116","chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p025","quote":"燕王"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"至孫定國，與父康王姬姦，生子男一人。奪弟妻為姬。與子女三人姦。定國有所欲誅殺臣肥如令郢人，郢人等告定國，定國使謁者以他法劾捕格殺郢人以滅口。至元朔元年，郢人昆弟復上書具言定國陰事，以此發覺。詔下公卿，皆議曰：「定國禽獸行，亂人倫，逆天，當誅。」上許之。定國自殺，國除為郡。","source_term":"父康王"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji051-003","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_A"}},{"id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_AB","label":"田蚡夫人（燕康王女，未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"女","mention_ids":["c-shiji-107-weiqi:m020-0007"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m020-0007","chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p020","quote":"女"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p020","quote":"夏，丞相取燕王女為夫人，有太后詔，召列侯宗室皆往賀。魏其侯過灌夫，欲與俱。夫謝曰：「夫數以酒失得過丞相，丞相今者又與夫有郤。」魏其曰：「事已解。」彊與俱。飲酒酣，武安起為壽，坐皆避席伏。已魏其侯為壽，獨故人避席耳，餘半膝席。灌夫不悅。起行酒，至武安，武安膝席曰：「不能滿觴。」夫怒，因嘻笑曰：「將軍貴人也，屬之！」時武安不肯。行酒次至臨汝侯，臨汝侯方與程不識耳語，又不避席。夫無所發怒，乃罵臨汝侯曰：「生平毀程不識不直一錢，今日長者為壽，乃效女兒呫囁耳語！」武安謂灌夫曰：「程李俱東西宮衛尉，今眾辱程將軍，仲孺獨不為李將軍地乎？」灌夫曰：「今日斬頭陷匈，何知程李乎！」坐乃起更衣，稍稍去。魏其侯去，麾灌夫出。武安遂怒曰：「此吾驕灌夫罪。」乃令騎留灌夫。灌夫欲出不得。籍福起為謝，案灌夫項令謝。夫愈怒，不肯謝。武安乃麾騎縛夫置傳舍，召長史曰：「今日召宗室，有詔。」劾灌夫罵坐不敬，系居室。遂按其前事，遣吏分曹逐捕諸灌氏支屬，皆得棄市罪。魏其侯大媿，為資使賓客請，莫能解。武安吏皆為耳目，諸灌氏皆亡匿，夫系，遂不得告言武安陰事。"}],"interpretation_note":"按本文明示父或祖父；缺名世代以星號標記而不造人物。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"parent_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_A"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-051","chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-051-jingyan:m009-0015","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m009-0018","c-shiji-051-jingyan:m010-0007"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-051-jingyan:p009","c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":2},{"source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-107","chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-107-weiqi:m020-0005"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-107-weiqi:p020"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-051-jingyan"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji051-002","subject_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p009","quote":"澤王燕二年，薨，謚為敬王。傳子嘉，為康王。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"傳子嘉","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示父、子分型；疏屬不補宗族支系，姬姦與弟妻不自動補婚姻或未名父母，定國案不冒稱獨立核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji051-003","subject_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_AA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p010","quote":"至孫定國，與父康王姬姦，生子男一人。奪弟妻為姬。與子女三人姦。定國有所欲誅殺臣肥如令郢人，郢人等告定國，定國使謁者以他法劾捕格殺郢人以滅口。至元朔元年，郢人昆弟復上書具言定國陰事，以此發覺。詔下公卿，皆議曰：「定國禽獸行，亂人倫，逆天，當誅。」上許之。定國自殺，國除為郡。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"父康王","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"明示父、子分型；疏屬不補宗族支系，姬姦與弟妻不自動補婚姻或未名父母，定國案不冒稱獨立核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji107-011","subject_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_AB","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p020","quote":"夏，丞相取燕王女為夫人，有太后詔，召列侯宗室皆往賀。魏其侯過灌夫，欲與俱。夫謝曰：「夫數以酒失得過丞相，丞相今者又與夫有郤。」魏其曰：「事已解。」彊與俱。飲酒酣，武安起為壽，坐皆避席伏。已魏其侯為壽，獨故人避席耳，餘半膝席。灌夫不悅。起行酒，至武安，武安膝席曰：「不能滿觴。」夫怒，因嘻笑曰：「將軍貴人也，屬之！」時武安不肯。行酒次至臨汝侯，臨汝侯方與程不識耳語，又不避席。夫無所發怒，乃罵臨汝侯曰：「生平毀程不識不直一錢，今日長者為壽，乃效女兒呫囁耳語！」武安謂灌夫曰：「程李俱東西宮衛尉，今眾辱程將軍，仲孺獨不為李將軍地乎？」灌夫曰：「今日斬頭陷匈，何知程李乎！」坐乃起更衣，稍稍去。魏其侯去，麾灌夫出。武安遂怒曰：「此吾驕灌夫罪。」乃令騎留灌夫。灌夫欲出不得。籍福起為謝，案灌夫項令謝。夫愈怒，不肯謝。武安乃麾騎縛夫置傳舍，召長史曰：「今日召宗室，有詔。」劾灌夫罵坐不敬，系居室。遂按其前事，遣吏分曹逐捕諸灌氏支屬，皆得棄市罪。魏其侯大媿，為資使賓客請，莫能解。武安吏皆為耳目，諸灌氏皆亡匿，夫系，遂不得告言武安陰事。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"燕王女","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"按本文明示親屬與本段人物承接；昆弟子保存叔伯長幼未定，父親未名。高祖孫只作祖父，不補其父姓名。如父子然及鬼故事不產生親屬或復活事件。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan","source_id":"s-shiji-051-jingyan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p009","quote":"澤王燕二年，薨，謚為敬王。傳子嘉，為康王。","source_term":"傳子嘉"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji051-002","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra","person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_A"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:m009-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"jo4_4bf_0ra_A","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-051-jingyan:p009","